 "remarks": "Nestled on 2.63 bucolic acres, this beautifully updated and expanded Colonial offers a private retreat in an enchanting natural setting, just minutes from the heart of New Canaan. Surrounded by lush landscaping, a picturesque pond, and spectacular seasonal views, this exceptional 4-bedroom, 5 full and 2 half-bath home blends comfort, elegance, and tranquility. Spacious, sun-filled living and entertaining areas feature walls of windows that bring the beauty of the outdoors in. The expansive gourmet chef's kitchen boasts top-of-the-line appliances and French doors opening to a lovely outdoor patio. The luxurious primary suite features a Juliet balcony, two walk-in closets, and a spacious ensuite bath. A fabulous second-floor bonus great room with a pool table offers additional space for relaxation and recreation. The finished walkout lower level features a fireplace, full bath, picture windows, and French doors opening to a private terrace and a 12' x 10' heated pool/spa, where the soothing sounds of a cascading waterfall enhance the serenity of this idyllic sanctuary. Additional highlights include a three-car heated garage, mudroom, two laundry areas, and a whole-house generator. Offered furnished, this exceptional property presents a wonderful opportunity to enjoy the very best of New Canaan living in a truly special and peaceful setting.",
